'''Gambler's Greed''' is a debuff that is created by an Opulent [[Ritual]].

Throughout the ritual, golden showers of coins will fall from the sky, forming [[area of effect]] circles on the ground. Any player standing within will be debuffed and take extra damage from all enemies and also receives increased [[item quantity]] and [[item rarity]] from slain enemies. This debuff cannot be removed by any means except by leaving the debuffing area or completing the Ritual.

Similar debuff could also be gained by breaking Cursed Urns spawned by monsters (or players if using {{il|Headhunter}}) with "Opulent" [[Archnemesis modifier]]. This does not grant increased item quantity and rarity, but decreases [[action speed]].

